@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Log in (copy "accessToken" from the response into @accessToken below)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-email@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

###
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Locations saved for the signed-in company
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Item names for the autocomplete
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/item-options
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save a purchase order (use Location_Code values returned by /api/locations)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "itemName": "Mango",
      "batchLocationCode": "EZCMP1/EZLOC-19",
      "standardCost": 100,
      "standardPrice": 150,
      "quantity": 5,
      "freeQuantity": 1,
      "discountPercent": 20
    },
    {
      "itemName": "Apple",
      "batchLocationCode": "EZCMP1/EZLOC-16",
      "standardCost": 50,
      "standardPrice": 80,
      "quantity": 10,
      "freeQuantity": 0,
      "discountPercent": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Recent orders
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders?take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### One order with its lines
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard widgets (latest orders, oldest items, quantity by item)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
